      "value": "I've also received a report of issues on Pico in a block of code that uses DateTime and does some math on Doubles. I have unfortunately not been able to get a simple repro because I don't have a Pico, and troubleshooting with the person who reported the bug to me has been difficult due to timezone and technical reasons. They claim it started happening around approximately September 6.\n\nJust wanted to add my voice here as another person experiencing Udon code that hasn't been touched for months suddenly failing to work on Pico, and only on Pico.",
